        <div class="pf-who-grid">
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Telford Tempest</strong><p>UK-made. Indirect pre-plumbed type. Good range of sizes. A popular Liverpool fit.</p></div></div>
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>RM Cylinders</strong><p>Good value pre-plumbed type. Strong on cost. Build quality holds up.</p></div></div>
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Joule</strong><p>Irish-made tanks. Strong reviews from our team. Solid 25-year warranty.</p></div></div>
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Gledhill StainlessLite</strong><p>One of the lightest unvented tanks on the market. UK-made in Blackpool since 1926.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Premium: Megaflo, OSO and Range Tribune</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.6;">Premium tanks from Megaflo, OSO and Range. Megaflo Eco is the most fitted unvented tank in the UK. OSO is a top brand from Norway. Range Tribune is a UK-made premium choice. All very energy efficient.</p>
        <div class="pf-who-grid">
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Megaflo Eco (Heatrae Sadia)</strong><p>The most fitted unvented tank in the UK. Tested to 15 bar pressure. Duplex stainless steel. 25-year warranty on the cylinder.</p></div></div>
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>OSO</strong><p>Top Norwegian brand. Premium build and very energy efficient. Strong on heat loss ratings.</p></div></div>
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Range Tribune</strong><p>UK-made premium unvented. High output coil for fast reheat. Good range of capacities.</p></div></div>
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Worcester Bosch Greenstore</strong><p>Pairs well with Worcester boilers. Made to work with the Greenstar range. Plus Greenskies solar panels.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <h3 style="color:var(--navy);font-size:1.25rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Speciality: Solar, Heat Pump and Horizontal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.6;">Speciality cylinders for big homes and tight spaces. Solar coil cylinders for solar thermal panels. Heat pump cylinders for air source heat pump (ASHP) systems. Horizontal cylinders for low-headroom spots like under the stairs. Tell us your needs and we will spec the right one.</p>
        <div class="pf-who-grid">
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Solar coil cylinders</strong><p>Twin coil setup. Top coil from the boiler. Bottom coil from solar thermal panels. Cuts gas use in summer.</p></div></div>
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Heat pump cylinders</strong><p>Bigger coil to work at the lower temps from an air source heat pump. We fit Megaflo HP and OSO Saga.</p></div></div>
          <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>Horizontal cylinders</strong><p>Gledhill StainlessLite Horizontal fits in low-headroom spots. Under the stairs. In the eaves. Anywhere a tall tank will not go.</p></div></div>
