        <div class="pf-who-item pf-who-yes"><span class="pf-who-icon">✓</span><div><strong>300 litres or more. Big family home.</strong><p>300 litres or more for big 4-bed and 5-bed homes with multiple bathrooms. Or homes with a high hot water demand. Allows long showers without running out.</p></div></div>
